<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-006-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.408112" lon="-120.943399"><name>SC26-006-A</name><cmt>SC26-006</cmt><desc>Morro outer reef high Raised rough reef with deeper terrain on its flanks. Terrain A 77/100; not catch probability. Center 131 ft; nearby 123–162 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional point-specific flag from this screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-057</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.41101873157252" lon="-120.94205865147089"/><trkpt lat="35.41083851166097" lon="-120.94206323500414"/><trkpt lat="35.41084413976496" lon="-120.94239344248363"/><trkpt lat="35.41030347988311" lon="-120.94240719063679"/><trkpt lat="35.410309106973344" lon="-120.94273739600528"/><trkpt lat="35.40976844692659" lon="-120.94275114158987"/><trkpt lat="35.40988105590703" lon="-120.94406966573189"/><trkpt lat="35.40952061555432" lon="-120.94407882341908"/><trkpt lat="35.409621969605844" lon="-120.94473693988255"/><trkpt lat="35.41007252022176" lon="-120.9447254963681"/><trkpt lat="35.4100631503496" lon="-120.94417515505872"/><trkpt lat="35.41033348060841" lon="-120.94416828699272"/><trkpt lat="35.410708911872995" lon="-120.94503968249835"/><trkpt lat="35.4108891321256" lon="-120.94503510561344"/><trkpt lat="35.4108065150